start without installing software.","evidence_ids":["cmd-dd54e27f98c145ca","cmd-ea977878d9bb4412","cmd-7e50ce3e6cb0441e","cmd-c12879d4687d4dc3","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1.0,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were observed. The script replacement and output generation directly implemented the task; the temporary edge-test directory was task-relevant and removed by its trap; repeated reconciliation runs collected bounded final/recovery evidence; and the reboot was required by the provider-wide protocol. Failed early executions did not run because the Python interpreters were absent, while restart polling was read-only. Lifecycle observations show no new temporary-file residue, package damage, or listening-service exposure; the socket PID/address changes are consistent with the required reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7e50ce3e6cb0441e","cmd-f4f4f7846e594cdc","cmd-26180c2741474c6d","cmd-aa61156c8ec04e6a","cmd-c12879d4687d4dc3","global:after_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_prepare:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The node1 restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart reconciliation was captured, restart was acknowledged, the boot ID changed, and the utility, outputs, source hashes, OS release, and kernel were verified after recovery. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Systemd failed-service inspection was unsupported on Alpine, although this task installs no daemon and the utility was directly exercised after restart.","Functional evidence covers the seeded data and targeted edge cases, not every possible malformed CSV structure."]}
